The task workspace, inbox, and user-created agent interaction model is inspired
by Multica (https://github.com/multica-ai/multica). This project does not embed
Multica source code.

This product includes software derived from dashi-taskboard
(https://github.com/chuspeeism/dashi-taskboard), Copyright the
dashi-taskboard authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

What is derived: the board's domain vocabulary (issue statuses, priorities,
relation kinds, the project/issue/comment/activity shape) and the issue-flow
rules its bundled Skill taught. The implementation is a rewrite against the
DeepSeek Harness plugin interfaces — none of the upstream server, storage,
CLI, browser, injection, desktop, or cloud code is carried over.

This product depends on, but does not include, DeepSeek Harness
(https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness), licensed under MIT.
